  "body": "Note: This is a liquidation sale. All applicable terms and conditions of sale shall apply. \r\n\r\nThis is a property with plenty to offer.\r\nDo-up, renovate, or explore a rebuild - the opportunity is yours to define.\r\n\r\nTwo separate buildings on an 837 m² freehold site, with  existing rental income and scope to improve. \r\n\r\nThe 59m² character bach, is complemented by a substantial secondary building with studio/rumpus, hobby/workroom, wash room facilities and double garaging. Together, the buildings offer approximately 155 m² of total improvements, including the garage.\r\n\r\nLIQUIDATION SALE-MUST SELL\r\n* 837 m² freehold land, more or less\r\n* Approx. 104 m² of bach and studio/rumpus space | 59 sqm (bach) + approx. 45 sqm (studio/rumpus) + garage \r\n* Approx. 155 m² of combined improvements \r\n* Character bach plus a separate, versatile secondary building\r\n* Double garage and three additional off-street parks\r\n* Currently returning $720 per week\r\n* Periodic tenancy\r\n\r\nThe information pack includes the Council-approved replacement plan for the secondary building, showing its documented layout and uses.\r\n\r\nContact Adam Gurr for viewing arrangements, or for any questions you may have. \r\n\r\nDisclaimer: The legal proprietor is in liquidation. All information has been compiled with care from third-party sources, including Auckland Council, and is provided as a general, indicative overview only. It should not be relied upon as expert advice. Neither the vendor, the liquidator, Harcourts NZ, nor Harcourts JK Realty Group Ltd (and licensees) make any representation or warranty as to the accuracy or completeness of the information and accept no liability for any errors or omissions. Purchasers must complete their own due diligence and seek independent legal and technical advice before proceeding.",
